        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>As a kind-hearted helper and time traveler, lend a hand to our adorable yet conflicted heroine! New possibilities lie ahead – how can we stop now?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game <i>Please Claim Your Social Security Card</i> unfolds in a realistic parallel world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, future humans have mastered time-travel technology to alter historical timelines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A discontented future citizen activates a cross-temporal link, summoning players to help their ancestor (the heroine) reshape history's course, hoping to secure a more prosperous birthright. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus begins the player's adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a windowed workplace simulation and text-based adventure game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players act as consultants to the heroine, Xiao Qiao, assisting her in daily social security card distribution tasks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through their work, players and Xiao Qiao will strive to complete assignments, experience the diversity of human life, and make critical decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong><br>The game alternates between daytime and nighttime phases:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daytime</strong>: Assist Xiao Qiao in distributing social security cards. Learn workflow processes, master the card issuance system, and apply this knowledge to solve citizens' problems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nighttime</strong>: Choose recreational activities for Xiao Qiao. Gain intriguing information while boosting specific skills through these interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story progresses, different choices lead to multiple endings.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refreshing soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witty dialogues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dramatic workplace scenarios</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heartwarming multiple endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special tribute</strong> to the creators of <i>Papers, Please</i> and all indie developers pushing the boundaries of gameplay innovation.</h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>As a kind-hearted helper and time traveler, lend a hand to our adorable yet conflicted heroine! New possibilities lie ahead – how can we stop now?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game <i>Please Claim Your Social Security Card</i> unfolds in a realistic parallel world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, future humans have mastered time-travel technology to alter historical timelines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A discontented future citizen activates a cross-temporal link, summoning players to help their ancestor (the heroine) reshape history's course, hoping to secure a more prosperous birthright. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus begins the player's adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a windowed workplace simulation and text-based adventure game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players act as consultants to the heroine, Xiao Qiao, assisting her in daily social security card distribution tasks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through their work, players and Xiao Qiao will strive to complete assignments, experience the diversity of human life, and make critical decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong><br>The game alternates between daytime and nighttime phases:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daytime</strong>: Assist Xiao Qiao in distributing social security cards. Learn workflow processes, master the card issuance system, and apply this knowledge to solve citizens' problems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nighttime</strong>: Choose recreational activities for Xiao Qiao. Gain intriguing information while boosting specific skills through these interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story progresses, different choices lead to multiple endings.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refreshing soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witty dialogues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dramatic workplace scenarios</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heartwarming multiple endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special tribute</strong> to the creators of <i>Papers, Please</i> and all indie developers pushing the boundaries of gameplay innovation.</h2>",
        "short_description": "This text-based adventure simulates window service work.As consultant to heroine Xiao Qiao, players assist her social security card distribution tasks:Master card issuance proceduresExperience diverse human interactionsGuide Xiao Qiao in finding her life purpose",
